heavy–light decomposition of a rooted tree or arborescence: each vertex’s heavy child is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its child with the largest subtree (the first in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order on a tie), and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"heavy edges form paths. Vertices get positions in a preorder that takes the heavy child first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so each heavy path and each subtree is an interval of positions, and any path between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"segments(from:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"title":"HeavyLightDecomposition","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/HeavyLightDecomposition/preorder-swift.property":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preorder","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","preciseIdentifier":"s:14TreeAlgorithms23HeavyLightDecompositionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"text":"Preorder","preciseIdentifier":"s:14TreeAlgorithms23HeavyLightDecompositionV8PreorderV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition\/preorder-swift.property","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The vertices by position: a preorder taking each vertex’s heavy child first, then its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other children in ","type":"text"},{"code":"children(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order. O(1).","type":"text"}],"ki